<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f1f5f9; margin: 0; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    .header { background: #0f172a; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; padding: 25px 20px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #f59e0b; }
    .content { padding: 30px 25px; color: #334155; }
    .pnr-box { background: #fef3c7; border: 1px dashed #d97706; padding: 15px; text-align: center; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .pnr-box span { display: block; font-size: 13px; color: #b45309; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold; }
    .pnr-box strong { font-size: 24px; color: #d97706; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .reason-box { background: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #d97706; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
    .reason-box span { font-size: 11px; color: #b45309; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .reason-box p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #78350f; font-weight: 600; }
    .details-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
    .details-table td { padding: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-size: 14px; }
    .details-table td.label { font-weight: bold; color: #475569; width: 40%; }
    .footer { background: #f8fafc; text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>BUS TICKET BOOKING SYSTEM</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Departure Schedule Rescheduled ⏰</h2>
      <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>Please be informed that the departure schedule for your upcoming bus trip has been modified because the assigned bus requires operational adjustments.</p>

      <div class="reason-box">
        <span>Reason for Schedule Adjustment</span>
        <p>{{reason}}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pnr-box">
        <span>BOOKING PNR</span>
        <strong>{{pnr}}</strong>
      </div>

      <table class="details-table">
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Route</td>
          <td><strong>{{source}} &rarr; {{destination}}</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Updated Departure Date</td>
          <td><strong style="color: #d97706;">{{departureDate}}</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Updated Departure Time</td>
          <td><strong style="color: #d97706;">{{departureTime}}</strong></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="label">Seat Reservations</td>
          <td><strong style="color: #16a34a;">Preserved & Reserved</strong></td>
        </tr>
      </table>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">Your seat numbers and booking details remain fully reserved. Please plan your arrival at the boarding point according to the updated departure schedule.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2026 Bus Ticket Booking System. Have a safe journey!</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
